post-it: Wants a good-looking screensaver
cause: No screensaver set
symptoms:
	Wants a screensaver
checks:
	yes: Picture is clean
	yes: Desktop icons open
	no: A screensaver is set
		shows: Display Properties, Screen Saver: (None)
software steps:
	Right-click the desktop, click Properties, then the Screen Saver tab
	Pick 3D Pipes under Screen Saver
	Click Apply
notes:
	"A good looking guy like me needs a good looking screensaver"
